WHY THIS EXISTS ALONGSIDE THE NUMBERED PATCHES

box86-patches/01..16 record why each change was made. They do not reconstruct
the tree: patch 16 alone covers four of the twenty-one modified files, and it
covers none of the nineteen UNTRACKED paths -- among which eight hand-written
sources existed nowhere but one working directory:

  src/mgs2_island_ab.c        src/mgs2_island_ffp.c
  src/mgs2_island_gl.c        src/mgs2_island_resolve.c
  src/mgs2_island_gl_trap.S   src/mgs2_island_class_b.h
  src/mgs2_island_entry_identity.h
  src/wrapped/wrappedlibegl.c (+ its private header and three generated defs)

Losing that directory would have lost the island.

